@startuml agentic-organization-operations-boundary
title Agentic Organization / Agentic Operations Boundary ; per ADR-ES-020 section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Organization" as AO
class "Agentic Operations" as AOp

AO --> AOp : may operate through

note right
  Per ADR-ES-020 section 7 + AORG-NEG-003 + AORG-NEG-014:
  - Agentic Organization is NOT Agentic Operations
  - Agentic Operations does NOT automatically make the Organization agentic
end note

@enduml
